        {
          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "Genuine `==` digest-equality checks (Ruby String#== short-circuits on the first differing byte), so the match is real: they are digests compared in non-constant time. Context in this repo: educational toy-blockchain demo scripts (openblockchains \"programming-blockchains\" book samples) that print true/false to stdout to verify a stored block hash against a recomputed SHA-256. No MAC is involved — no keyed digest exists anywhere in this repo — and there is no remote adversary or timing channel in "
